usage: native-workspace-linux.py [-h] --root ROOT --out OUT --package PACKAGE
                                 --controller CONTROLLER --template-rootfs
                                 TEMPLATE_ROOTFS --rootfs-inputs ROOTFS_INPUTS
                                 --source-commit SOURCE_COMMIT
                                 --package-sha256 PACKAGE_SHA256
                                 --runtime-sha256 RUNTIME_SHA256
                                 --afs-meta-sha256 AFS_META_SHA256
                                 --afs-node-sha256 AFS_NODE_SHA256
                                 [--semantics-only | --source-rejection-only]
                                 [--semantics-probe SEMANTICS_PROBE]
                                 [--semantics-groups {locks,append,mmap_inotify,permissions_errno} [{locks,append,mmap_inotify,permissions_errno} ...]]

Bounded real OwnerFs managed-container lifecycle, not production ON
qualification.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --out OUT
  --package PACKAGE
  --controller CONTROLLER
  --template-rootfs TEMPLATE_ROOTFS
  --rootfs-inputs ROOTFS_INPUTS
  --source-commit SOURCE_COMMIT
  --package-sha256 PACKAGE_SHA256
  --runtime-sha256 RUNTIME_SHA256
  --afs-meta-sha256 AFS_META_SHA256
  --afs-node-sha256 AFS_NODE_SHA256
  --semantics-only      run selected short semantics and necessary lifecycle
                        identity only; omit unchanged 64MiB basic payload
  --source-rejection-only
                        only reject an unknown source field on a live managed
                        container and prove legal exec/normal stop
  --semantics-probe SEMANTICS_PROBE
                        optional short mixed-path checks before normal stop
  --semantics-groups {locks,append,mmap_inotify,permissions_errno} [{locks,append,mmap_inotify,permissions_errno} ...]
                        only run affected groups; omitted groups retain their
                        original evidence
